Animal welfare is the law, and we are enforcing it. 🐾🇺🇸

@SecKennedy and I brought together partners from @USDA, @HHSGov, the @TheJusticeDept, @EPA, and @LaraLeaTrump to strengthen enforcement and protect dogs.

This year, USDA has inspected more than 2,000 dog breeder and broker facilities, trained 98 inspectors, and created a new Animal Protection Bureau to improve compliance and address violations. 

HHS has launched more than 20 initiatives to reduce unnecessary animal testing and advance human-based research methods.

I want to give a special thank you to Lauree Simmons, @BDRRescue, and other organizations who champion this important effort. 

@POTUS’s administration will continue to fight for animal welfare, or as Bobby said: we’re going to Make America Humane Again.
